    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "oad_readme#18",
      "doc_id": "oad_readme",
      "heading": "ObsAwareData README > License and citation",
      "text": "The data are released under the [Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License](LICENSE) (CC BY 4.0). The underlying CDC and Census data are public; please also acknowledge the original sources listed in [DATA_SOURCES.md](DATA_SOURCES.md). How to cite this dataset: see [CITATION.cff](CITATION.cff).\n\nThis dataset contains only aggregated public surveillance data. It contains no individual-level or protected health information."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "oad_data_sources#3",
      "doc_id": "oad_data_sources",
      "heading": "ObsAwareData data sources > 1. Hospital admissions: NHSN Hospital Respiratory Data (HRD)",
      "text": "- **Fields used:** total new admissions with a confirmed diagnosis (COVID-19, influenza, RSV), and the number of hospitals reporting those admissions. All other HRD fields are excluded: bed occupancy, ICU counts, age breakdowns, rates, and change measures.\n- **Geography:** State (jurisdiction). DC is included; territories and national or regional aggregates are excluded.\n- **Note:** Hospitals were not required to report RSV admissions before August 2024. RSV hospital data for weeks up to 2024-08-03 are therefore marked `structural_absent`, not missing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "oad_data_sources#0",
      "doc_id": "oad_data_sources",
      "heading": "ObsAwareData data sources",
      "text": "All inputs are public data published by the US Centers for Disease Control and Prevention (CDC) and the US Census Bureau. They were downloaded as the full nationwide files; each state's tables are a filter of those files, not separately obtained data. Every release used is kept unmodified in the public [archive of CDC releases](https://github.com/jiandewu/ObsAwareData-pipeline), with its release date and SHA-256 checksum."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "oad_data_sources#2",
      "doc_id": "oad_data_sources",
      "heading": "ObsAwareData data sources > 1. Hospital admissions: NHSN Hospital Respiratory Data (HRD)",
      "text": "- **Releases used:** <!-- auto:releases_nhsn -->118<!-- /auto:releases_nhsn --> dated downloads of the full file, the latest dated <!-- auto:newest_nhsn -->2026-10-16<!-- /auto:newest_nhsn -->. Some are the preliminary release and some the main release. `source_snapshot_id` records which release each row came from (`..._preliminary_...` or `..._standard_...`). \"Standard\" is only a label for the non-preliminary file; it does not mean the values are final. Releases from 2026-10-07 on are the API's CSV export, which rounds the few NHSN values that end in .5 half to even; earlier files rounded them half up, so those values can differ by 1 between the two (no other difference)."
