      "heading": "CDCgov/NWSS README > CDC NWSS Public Data",
      "text": "CDC NWSS produces publicly available datasets that are updated weekly.\n\nPublic datasets include: \n  - [CDC Wastewater Data for SARS-CoV-2](https://data.cdc.gov/Public-Health-Surveillance/CDC-Wastewater-Data-for-SARS-CoV-2/j9g8-acpt/about_data)\n  - [CDC Wastewater Data for Influenza A](https://data.cdc.gov/Public-Health-Surveillance/CDC-Wastewater-Data-for-Influenza-A/ymmh-divb/about_data)\n  - [CDC Wastewater Data for Avian Influenza (H5)](https://data.cdc.gov/Public-Health-Surveillance/CDC-Wastewater-Data-for-Avian-Influenza-A-H5-/mtpu-urpp/about_data)\n  - [CDC Wastewater Data for RSV](https://data.cdc.gov/Public-Health-Surveillance/CDC-Wastewater-Data-for-RSV/45cq-cw4i/about_data)"
